  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Enlargement of a dwelling house (Class B) </span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- The operations comprising the erection of a hip to gable and rear dormer roof extension would consist of the enlargement of a dwelling house\r\nwithin the meaning of Class B of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the Town &amp; Country\r\nPlanning (General Permitted Development)&nbsp;\r\n(England) Order 2015 \"the Order\" and would comply with the\r\ndevelopment tolerances set out in said Class B. The operation would therefore\r\nhave been granted planning permission by Article 3 of the Order.</span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Alteration to the roof of the dwelling house (Class C)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The operations comprising the installation of x2 roof lights to the front roof slope would consist of any other alteration to the roof of the\r\ndwelling house within the meaning of Class C of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the\r\nTown &amp; Country Planning (General Permitted Development)&nbsp; (England) Order 2015 \"the Order\"\r\nand would comply with the development tolerances set out in said Class C. The\r\noperation would therefore have been granted planning permission by Article 3 of\r\nthe Order.</span></span></p>"
